    <statement><p>Use long division to find the quotient and remainder when 
<me>f(x)=-1 x^5  - 6 x^4 + 9 x^3 + 3 x^2 + 7 x  - 9</me>
is divided by <me>g(x)=-7 x^2  - 4 x + 7.</me></p>
<p>The quotient is <fillin characters="20" name="AnSwEr0001"/>.</p>
<p>The remainder is <fillin characters="10" name="AnSwEr0002"/>.</p>
</statement>
    <answer>
      <p>
        <m>0.142857x^{3}+0.77551x^{2}+\left(-1.58601\right)x+1.25323</m>
      </p>
    </answer>
    <answer>
      <p>
        <m>23.115x+\left(-17.7726\right)</m>
      </p>
    </answer>
